{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p019a","title":"曹操过吕伯奢家杀人","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-a-p019-wei","label":"《魏书》","text":"《魏书》称吕伯奢不在，其子与宾客劫取曹操财物，曹操反击杀数人。","evidence":["wudi-q-p019-wei"]},{"id":"wudi-a-p019-shiyu","label":"《世语》","text":"《世语》称吕伯奢诸子礼待曹操，曹操疑其谋害，夜杀八人离去。","evidence":["wudi-q-p019-shiyu"]},{"id":"wudi-a-p019-zaji","label":"孙盛《杂记》","text":"孙盛《杂记》称曹操误以食器声为图己，夜杀后说宁负人而不受人负。","evidence":["wudi-q-p019-zaji"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"杀人","evidence":["wudi-e-p019a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"成皋","evidence":["wudi-e-p019a-q"]},"time":{"label":"曹操东归途中","year":189,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-p019a-q","wudi-q-o008","wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855"],"chronology":"wudi-y189","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o008","basis":"曹操东归途中","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,82,"P019a"],"order":46}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p019a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-a66c9ff4e5a118c1ef05","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“太祖以卓终必覆败，遂不就拜，逃归乡里。从数骑过故人成皋吕伯奢，伯奢不在。其子与宾客共劫太祖，取马及物；太祖手刃击杀数人。”《世语》曰：“太祖过伯奢，伯奢出行。五子皆在，备宾主礼。太祖自以背卓命，疑其图己，手剑夜杀八人而去。”孙盛《杂记》曰：“太祖闻其食器声，以为图己，遂夜杀之。既而凄怆曰：‘宁我负人，毋人负我！’遂行。”","attribution":"《魏书》、《世语》、孙盛《杂记》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-263993825415cda96e51","start":0,"end":171,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-c8312ddce42041c69855","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c8312ddce42041c69855","layer":"modern","quote":"〖14〗杀太后及弘农王：董卓杀何太后在中平六年（公元 189），但杀弘农王则在第二年的正月。见《后汉书》卷八《灵帝纪》、卷九《献帝纪》。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":76,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-449cc7b499c8a1fee35c","start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o008","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9faaac9907c958c4d4d1","layer":"original","quote":"卓到，废帝为弘农王而立献帝〖7〗，京都大乱。卓表太祖为骁骑校尉〖8〗，欲与计事。太祖乃变易姓名，间行东归〖9〗；﹝二﹞出关〖10〗，过中牟〖11〗。为亭长所疑〖12〗，执诣县。邑中或窃识之〖13〗，为请得解。﹝三﹞卓遂杀太后及弘农王〖14〗。太祖至陈留〖15〗，散家财，合义兵，将以诛卓。冬十二月，始起兵于己吾〖16〗。﹝四﹞是岁，中平六年也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":172,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p019-shiyu","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-a66c9ff4e5a118c1ef05","layer":"pei","quote":"《世语》曰：“太祖过伯奢，伯奢出行。五子皆在，备宾主礼。太祖自以背卓命，疑其图己，手剑夜杀八人而去。","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-263993825415cda96e51","start":71,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p019-wei","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-a66c9ff4e5a118c1ef05","layer":"pei","quote":"《魏书》曰：“太祖以卓终必覆败，遂不就拜，逃归乡里。从数骑过故人成皋吕伯奢，伯奢不在。其子与宾客共劫太祖，取马及物；太祖手刃击杀数人。","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-263993825415cda96e51","start":3,"end":70,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p019-zaji","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-a66c9ff4e5a118c1ef05","layer":"pei","quote":"孙盛《杂记》曰：“太祖闻其食器声，以为图己，遂夜杀之。既而凄怆曰：‘宁我负人，毋人负我！’遂行。","attribution":"孙盛《杂记》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":81,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-263993825415cda96e51","start"